# The App Store page's list (System settings → App Store), which q2-coda's Q2s fetch from this repo's main.
# One app a line: "owner/repo TAG ASSET SIZE SHA256 Name", the name optional, pinning the exact release zip
# a Q2 installs; a Q2 refuses a zip whose SHA-256 differs. "-" before a line drops the app. "serial" numbers
# the list, and the last line is the q2-coda release key's signature of everything before it: a Q2 takes no
# list that fails it. Change it with tools/shelf.py (pin, digest, sign), never by hand alone; see
# docs/internals.md#q2-shelf and docs/releasing.md#the-app-list.
serial 2
